# SAND bot — Raiders of Sophie

## Scope

- `cogs/sand/` — `/sand craft`, `query_engine.py`, `guides_funnel.py` (Raiders of Sophie)
- `data/sand_knowledge.json` — wiki recipes (via `scripts/scrape_sand_wiki.py`)
- `data/sand_pristine_recipes.json` — in-game workshop Pristine costs (not on wiki)
- `scripts/sand_guides_import.py` — import/republish guide embeds from crossposts
- `scripts/verify_sand_commands.py` — check `/sand` registration on both guilds
- Registry key `sand_general` — SAND discussion channel (both guilds)

## Embed UX

- No embed author line (no "Made by bloodletting" header)
- Materials: clean lines like steam codes hub — `2× Scrap Metal`, not code-block tables
- `pristine 40mm` / `40m`, `80mm` / `80m`, `70mm` / `70m` → single turret + that ammo's materials
- Bare `pristine` → two-column hub of all three turrets

## Data

- Pristine upgrade costs: `data/sand_pristine_recipes.json` (in-game workshop UI — not on wiki)
- Wiki scrape: `data/sand_knowledge.json` via `scripts/scrape_sand_wiki.py`
- Show full upgrade material list per calibre; requires matching **Worn** turret at **S&H Armaments Workshop**
